  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Apart from rewards, this credit card also offers 8 complimentary domestic lounge visits every year. Other benefits like fuel surcharge waiver and up to 20% dining discount at partner restaurants further enhance its value. Like the platinum variant, this credit card also comes with no joining or annual fees. However, despite being an upgraded variant, the Signature Credit Card offers the same reward rate as the base variant. The key differentiator is only the addition of complimentary lounge access. Overall, this card is a decent option for consumers seeking to save on LIC premium payments while availing basic travel benefits.",
